		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour a tous,</p><p>J&#039;ai cette function</p><p>--- Function<br />CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION f_count_rec (vTableName text)<br /> RETURNS int4<br /> LANGUAGE plpgsql<br />AS $$<br />declare<br />&#160; &#160; vCount &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; int4;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; stmt&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; text;<br />begin<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; stmt := &#039;select count (*) from &#039;||vTableName;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; execute stmt into vCount;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;return vCount;<br />end;<br />$$</p><p>Marche correctement </p><br /><p>---&#160; Table pour test <br />create table testr (testr int)<br />insert into testr values (10);<br />insert into testr values (20);<br />insert into testr values (30);</p><p>--- Count <br />select count(*) <br />from<br />testr</p><p>-- Execution de la funtion <br />select f_count_rec(&#039;testr&#039;);</p>]]></content>
